Four metadata-identified records are retained as candidate comparison points:
Levitt and Vogtmann's surface-group Whitehead algorithm \citep{P32-CW01};
Venkov and Zograf's finite-index Fuchsian-group factorization \citep{P32-CW02};
Blute, Cockett, Jacqmin, and Scott's generalized power-series construction
\citep{P32-CW03}; and Parry and Pollicott's periodic-orbit zeta monograph
\citep{P32-CW04}.

\textbf{Conditional scalar lemma.}  If \(\ell>0\), \(s>0\) is real, and
\(m\geq2\) is an integer, then
\[
 \Phi_m(s)=\bigl(1-e^{-s\ell/m}\bigr)^{-m}
 \;>\;
 B(s)=\bigl(1-e^{-s\ell}\bigr)^{-1}.

